<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41599" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχᾰράσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχάλκ-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cut into,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύλλον ἐπικεχαραγμένον</span> a
				<i>notched</i> or <i>serrated</i> leaf, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				6.2.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>slash through,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ μίαν ἐπιβολὴν ὅλα τὰ σώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heliod.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				47.14.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>impress upon,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοῦν νομίσμασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Publ.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be branded,</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵπποις</span>] <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικεχαράχθαι
			πρόσωπον</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				<u>Oxy.</u>
				1086.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>impress subsequently,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.64
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
